summary:

The heart-to-heart why behind the Learn Anything with AI retreat: learning how to learn anything, with AI as the accelerator, and learning it together in person. AI is here to stay; the interesting question is how to thrive with it. Curious what convinced me to organize a five day learning retreat with Dan Chen? Read on to find out!
